0..54 Comment "//! This source transports values backward along `ua`."
55..58 Comment "//!"
59..133 Comment "//! Backward transport applies the left inverse of the equivalence record."
134..186 Comment "//! The examples transport integers to circle loops."
187..190 Comment "//!"
191..243 Comment "//! The checker expands the backward `ua` transport."
244..294 Comment "//! The runtime evaluates each named reverse path."
295..367 Comment "//! It reads the case table of § 4.5 of the cited work at the universe."
